# ORIGINS runtime decisions

- Authoritative integration branch is `origins-game-v1`.
- Do not use the previous ChatGPT multipart WemadeMir2 ZIP as an asset source.
- Use public Suprcode Crystal/Crystal.Database references and public Mir2 asset mirrors for map/player source material.
- Use `Suprcode/Zircon` plus matching public Zircon `.Zl` assets for GameInter/UI reconstruction.
- Selected interface family is Zircon. Crystal GameInter is reference/history only.
- First dungeon theme is coherent grey Zuma (`zuma_gray`). Do not mix unrelated cave art.
- STANDARD room: SOUTH entrance + NORTH exit.
- Every normal floor reuses the STANDARD room architecture; controlled decoration/obstacle variation is allowed later.
- KING_ROOM: SOUTH entrance only, no NORTH exit, closed perimeter.
- Player locomotion uses Crystal 8-direction standing/walk/run source frames and existing ORIGINS movement controller.
- Preserve the Zircon Focus/FP resource in desktop reconstruction until its ORIGINS gameplay role is explicitly decided.
- Desktop reconstruction first; mobile redesign later.
- No generated/redrawn substitute art when real source assets exist.
- No monsters, combat, spells or networking in the first integrated vertical slice.
- Never delete/move/rename existing project files without explicit approval.
